OL,3,GNEWSAMen sentenced over #136k Covid
OL,4,Avaccine fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been sentenced for selling
OL,7,F2,000 fake Covid-19 vaccination records
OL,8,Fto people who had not had the jab.
OL,10,FWaqas Hanif, 28, and Touqir Nasir, 31,
OL,11,Fboth from Luton, created false
OL,12,Fdocuments at Kingsway Health Centre,
OL,13,Fwhere Hanif worked on the vaccination
OL,14,Fprogramme, and sold them online.
OL,16,FA joint NHS and National Crime Agency
OL,17,F(NCA) investigation led to their arrest
OL,18,Fand the seizure of #136,00 from a
OL,19,Fsafety deposit box rented by Hanif.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
